PARITY MAPPING (web → Apple platform tokens; no Tailwind ported)
  GlassPanel(p-4)         → TSGlassPanel (Sources/Components/UI/Cards.swift; pad TSSpacing.lg = 16 = web p-4)
  label (text-xs muted)  → Font.TS.caption + Color.TS.textMuted, single-line truncate
  icon (Lucide, h-3.5)   → SF Symbol (systemImage:), decorative → .accessibilityHidden(true)
  value (text-lg semibold)→ Font.TS.section (18pt semibold = exact text-lg font-semibold), tinted, truncate
  title={String(display)}→ .help(Text(verbatim: display))  (hover/long-press full value)
  sub (text-[10px] muted)→ Font.TS.caption + Color.TS.textMuted, raised to the legible caption role for Dynamic Type
  boolean → Yes/No        → InfoTileValue.boolean → InfoTileStrings infoTile.boolean.yes/no (P1/S10; no literals in code)
  number                  → locale-aware NumberFormatter (idiomatic over the web bare String(n)); non-finite → em-dash
  empty / blank value     → InfoTileStrings infoTile.empty "—"  (native addition: a tile is never a blank box)
  color → InfoTileTint    : text-primary/(default/empty)→primary · text-secondary→secondary · text-muted→muted ·
                            emerald/green/teal→success · amber/yellow/orange→warning · rose/red/pink→danger ·
                            cyan/sky/blue/indigo→info · accent→accent ; unknown→primary (web `?? text-primary` parity)
  a11y      : whole tile = one VoiceOver element (.accessibilityElement(children: .combine)); icon hidden.
  telemetry : view.opened surface="InfoTile" via InfoTileSurface.reportOpen (P1/S11), default OSLog sink.

